@Passage-Section Smalltalk-80 implementation and release
@Passage-Text And then we worked with the folks at Berkeley [Dave Patterson and David Ungar, the SPARC team], and with Eliott Moss at UMass, and Ralph Johnson in Illinois, but basically the initial release then went out and we ended up with a spec for the implementation of what was Smalltalk-80.
@Passage-Context Goldberg discusses collaboration with university researchers on the Smalltalk-80 implementation and its initial release.
